@Struo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5221

### Ping (API surface smoke check)
GET {{Struo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ping
Accept: application/json

### Liveness probe
GET {{Struo.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness probe (checks DB connectivity)
GET {{Struo.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### API reference (Scalar, non-production only)
GET {{Struo.Api_HostAddress}}/scalar
